          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndaŵi jimkupeleka miasi ja mbopesi kwa une, mkajipeleka pampepe ni mkate wana cakusasaŵilisya, kapena mawuta ga nyama gakupelecedwa pa lisiku lya cindimba cangu, gakagona mpaka kundaŵi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
